---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Darwin - Thoughtlyfe">
  <main>
    <section class="section bg-card">
      <div class="container mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="heading-1 mb-6">About Darwin Nicholas Hayle</h1>
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <img
            src="/images/author/darwin-hayle.jpg"
            alt="Darwin Nicholas Hayle"
            class="w-48 h-48 rounded-full mx-auto mb-8 object-cover shadow-lg"
          />
          <p class="text-body text-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Darwin Nicholas Hayle is a spiritual guide, intuitive reader, and consciousness coach dedicated to helping individuals unlock their highest potential and live a life aligned with their soul's purpose. With over two decades of experience in metaphysical studies, energy healing, and ancient wisdom traditions, Darwin offers profound insights and practical tools for personal transformation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body text-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            His journey began at a young age, marked by a deep curiosity about the unseen world and a natural ability to perceive energy. This led him to explore various spiritual disciplines, including meditation, sacred geometry, crystal healing, and esoteric philosophy. He has trained with renowned spiritual masters and healers from around the globe, integrating diverse teachings into his unique approach.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Darwin's mission is to empower others to connect with their inner wisdom, release limiting beliefs, and embrace their authentic selves. He believes that true fulfillment comes from understanding our soul's contract and aligning our actions with our divine blueprint. Through his readings, courses, and personalized guidance, he illuminates pathways to clarity, peace, and spiritual awakening.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-light">
      <div class="container mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-title">My Philosophy</h2>
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <p class="text-body text-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Darwin's philosophy is rooted in the understanding that every individual possesses an innate capacity for self-healing and spiritual growth. He emphasizes the importance of conscious awareness, personal responsibility, and compassionate self-inquiry as foundations for transformation.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            He guides clients to recognize their unique energetic signature and to harness universal laws for manifestation and abundance. His work is a blend of intuitive insight, practical wisdom, and heart-centered guidance, designed to support you in creating a life of joy, purpose, and spiritual alignment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-card">
      <div class="container mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-title">Client Testimonials</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <div class="card p-6 text-left">
            <p class="text-body italic mb-4">
              "Working with Darwin has been truly life-changing. His insights are incredibly accurate, and his guidance is always delivered with such compassion and wisdom. I finally understand my soul's path!"
            </p>
            <p class="font-semibold text-primary">— Sarah L., New York</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-6 text-left">
            <p class="text-body italic mb-4">
              "Darwin's crystal healing course opened my eyes to a whole new world of energy. I feel more connected to myself and the universe than ever before. Highly recommend!"
            </p>
            <p class="font-semibold text-primary">— Michael T., London</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section text-center text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary">
      <div class="container mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Ready to Begin Your Journey?</h2>
          <p class="text-xl mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto opacity-95">
            Explore Darwin's offerings and take the next step on your path to spiritual awakening and self-mastery.
          </p>
          <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="/readings" class="btn bg-white text-black hover:bg-gray-100">Book a Reading</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-black">Contact Darwin</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

